01:02:36.982 --> 01:02:40.527
{\an8}The closed Patan High School
We are remodeling the observatory.

1019
01:02:40.611 --> 01:02:42.029
{\an8}The designer is from New York

1020
01:02:42.821 --> 01:02:44.156
{\an8}Come to my workplace
What are you doing?

1021
01:02:44.239 --> 01:02:46.074
{\an8}- Are you really not going to quit?
- Song Ha-kyung

1022
01:02:46.784 --> 01:02:48.702
{\an8}- Do you like Baek Do-ha that much?
- I like it

1023
01:02:48.786 --> 01:02:49.620
{\an8}On July 7th

1024
01:02:49.703 --> 01:02:51.997
{\an8}If I confess under the summer triangle,

1025
01:02:52.080 --> 01:02:54.374
{\an8}They say we will never break up

1026
01:02:54.458 --> 01:02:58.420
{\an8}I don't want to remember you
Why does it appear in front of me like this?

1027
01:02:59.129 --> 01:03:00.839
{\an8} Hate me as much as you want
next to me

1028
01:03:00.923 --> 01:03:02.257
{\an8}Hey!

1029
01:03:02.341 --> 01:03:04.802
{\an8} During this summer
Because you'll like it

1030
01:03:05.886 --> 01:03:07.471
{\an8}Are you really here?
Are you saying you want to live with me?

1031
01:03:08.430 --> 01:03:10.891
{\an8}What are you? What right do you have?

1032
01:03:11.391 --> 01:03:13.727
{\an8}If you're looking for rights, it's not you...

